<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shop | Home</title>
    <link href="https://unpkg.com/boxicons@2.1.4/css/boxicons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
       body {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50, #3498db);
    color: white;
    font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100vh;
    text-align: center;
}

.header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 80%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    padding: 15px 30px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

.logo {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #fff;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 0 10px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

nav a:hover, nav a.active {
    color: #1abc9c;
    transform: scale(1.1);
}

h3.dd {
    font-size: 3em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.welcome-section {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    max-width: 600px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

.welcome-section h2 {
    font-size: 36px;
    color: #f1c40f;
}

.welcome-section p {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    color: #ecf0f1;
}

.btn {
    background-color: #1abc9c;
    color: white;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 18px;
    transition: 0.3s ease;
}

.btn:hover {
    background-color: #16a085;
    transform: scale(1.05);
}

    </style>

</head>
<body>

    <header class="header">
        <h1 class="logo">Shop</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="#" class="active">الصفحة الرئيسية</a>
            <a href="/Technicalsupport">دعم فني</a>
            <a href="/Profile">ملف شخصي</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- حاوية العنوان وفقرة الترحيب -->
    <div class="welcome-container">
        <h3 class="dd">Welcome</h3>
        
        <div class="welcome-section">
            <h2>مرحبًا بك في موقعنا</h2>
            <p>نحن نقدم أفضل الخدمات لتلبية احتياجاتك!</p>
        </div>
    </div>

   
</html>
